Scenario: Add Audio Via Web Content
Priority: 4
	Given these properties
		|custom.properties|editor.wysiwyg.portal-impl.portlet.ddm.text_html.ftl=ckeditor|
	When these properties
		|test.name.skip.portal.instance|WebcontentUsecase#AddAudioViaWebContent|
	And these properties
		|testray.component.names|Web Content Administration|
	And ProductMenu goto Control Panel Configuration
		|portlet|Server Administration|
	And ServerAdministration configure External Services
		|enableXuggler|true|
	And Navigator open URL
	And ProductMenu goto Sites Content
		|portlet|Documents and Media|
	And DMDocument add CP
		|dmDocumentDescription|DM Document Description|
		|dmDocumentFile|Document_1.mp3|
		|dmDocumentTitle|Document_1.mp3|
	And DMNavigator goto Document CP
		|dmDocumentTitle|Document_1.mp3|
	And DMNavigator goto URL Detail
	And these variables
		|dmDocumentURL|selenium#getElementValue('//input[contains(@id,\'url\')]')|
	And Navigator open URL
	And ProductMenu goto Sites Content
		|portlet|Web Content|
	And WebContentNavigator goto Add CP
	And WebContent add Via CK Editor
		|webContentContent|WC WebContent Content|
		|webContentTitle|WC WebContent Title|
	And WebContent upload Audio
		|dmDocumentURL|${dmDocumentURL}|
	And PortletEntry publish
	And Page add
		|pageName|Web Content Display Page|
	And Navigator goto Page
		|pageName|Web Content Display Page|
	And Portlet add PG
		|portletName|Web Content Display|
	And Navigator goto Page
		|pageName|Web Content Display Page|
	And WebContentDisplayPortlet select Web Content
		|webContentTitle|WC WebContent Title|
	And Navigator goto Page
		|pageName|Web Content Display Page|
	Then WebContent view Audio Via WCD
